  "query_preview": "/MONDAY NIGHT THROUGH SATURDAY/...\nIssued at 107 PM CDT Sat May 9 2026\n\nAn upper-level ridge will build into the central Plains on \nMonday as highs warm into the 70s then back into the 80s on \nTuesday as the ridge continues to move east. An upper-level \ndisturbance and weak front will move through the region Tuesday \nnight into early Wednesday. A drier air mass will be in place \nand coverage in the showers and a few storms may be limited. \n\nSlightly cooler temperatures in the 70s will occur behind the\nfront on Wednesday. The upper-level ridge then moves east over \nthe region late week into next week. Highs will likely warm \nwell into the 80s, with some locations approaching 90 degrees \npossible on Friday into early next week.",
